{
  "title": { "zh": "验证两条滤波路径", "en": "Verify spatial and frequency paths" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "你有空间卷积器和频域处理器，现在让同一个规则走两条路径。先将边界设为周期，避免把不同问题当作算法误差；计算工具处理复数乘法，你核对信息路径。 <wiki-ref to=\"convolution-theorem\"></wiki-ref>",
        "en": "You have spatial and frequency processors. Run one rule through both, using periodic boundaries so the comparison is fair. Arithmetic parts handle complex multiplication while you check the information path. <wiki-ref to=\"convolution-theorem\"></wiki-ref>"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "\\[\\mathcal F(x*h)[k]=N\\,\\mathcal F(x)[k]\\,\\mathcal F(h)[k]\\]\n\n这里 ∗ 是周期卷积，h 是同一卷积器的单位脉冲响应，行长为 N。因为 F 每次都除以 N，两个系数相乘会多出一次缩小，所以右侧需要乘 N。空间与频域等价还要求相同的核原点、边界和输出域；公式等价不保证当前实现更快。 <wiki-ref to=\"convolution-theorem\"></wiki-ref>",
    "en": "\\[\\mathcal F(x*h)[k]=N\\,\\mathcal F(x)[k]\\,\\mathcal F(h)[k]\\]\n\nHere ∗ is circular convolution and h the same convolver’s unit-impulse response on a row of length N. Each F divides by N, so multiplying two coefficients introduces an extra scale reduction, requiring the factor N. Equivalence also requires matched kernel origin, borders and output domain; it does not guarantee a faster implementation. <wiki-ref to=\"convolution-theorem\"></wiki-ref>"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "v2_convolution_theorem",
      "kind": "circuit",
      "step": {
        "zh": "验证两条路径",
        "en": "Verify both paths"
      },
      "brief": {
        "zh": "空间路径使用周期卷积。频域路径把图像频谱与同一卷积器的单位脉冲响应频谱相乘，再重建；本归一化下系数乘积需要乘 N。输出两条路径及误差。",
        "en": "The spatial path uses periodic convolution. Multiply the signal spectrum by the spectrum of the convolver’s impulse response, then reconstruct. With this normalisation multiply the coefficient product by N. Output both paths and their error."
      },
      "inputs": [
        { "name": "image", "label": { "zh": "行信号", "en": "Row signal" } },
        { "name": "kernel", "label": { "zh": "数学卷积核", "en": "Convolution kernel" } },
        { "name": "impulse", "label": { "zh": "单位脉冲", "en": "Unit impulse" } }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        { "name": "spatial", "label": { "zh": "空间卷积", "en": "Spatial convolution" } },
        { "name": "frequency", "label": { "zh": "频域路径", "en": "Frequency path" } },
        { "name": "error", "label": { "zh": "两路径误差", "en": "Path error" } }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [[0.2, 0.8, 0.3, 0.5]],
            "kernel": [[0.25, 0.5, 0.25]],
            "impulse": [[1, 0, 0, 0]]
          },
          "expect": {
            "spatial": [[0.42500000000000004, 0.525, 0.475, 0.375]],
            "frequency": [[0.42500000000000004, 0.525, 0.475, 0.375]],
            "error": [[0, 0, 0, 0]]
          }
        },
        {
          "inputs": {
            "image": [
              [
                0.5,
                0.5414213562373095,
                0.3,
                0.05857864376269048,
                0.09999999999999995,
                0.25857864376269046,
                0.3,
                0.3414213562373095
              ]
            ],
            "kernel": [[0.5, 0, -0.5]],
            "impulse": [[1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]]
          },
          "expect": {
            "spatial": [
              [
                0.09999999999999998,
                -0.1,
                -0.24142135623730948,
                -0.10000000000000002,
                0.09999999999999999,
                0.10000000000000002,
                0.041421356237309526,
                0.1
              ]
            ],
            "frequency": [
              [
                0.09999999999999998,
                -0.1,
                -0.24142135623730948,
                -0.10000000000000002,
                0.09999999999999999,
                0.10000000000000002,
                0.041421356237309526,
                0.1
              ]
            ],
            "error": [[0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]]
          }
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "inputs": { "image": [[1, 2, 4, 8]], "kernel": [[2, -1, 3]], "impulse": [[1, 0, 0, 0]] },
          "expect": { "spatial": [[27, 9, 18, 6]], "frequency": [[27, 9, 18, 6]], "error": [[0, 0, 0, 0]] }
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "h = spatialProcessor[form=dense,outside=wrap](impulse,kernel)",
        "x = spectrum(image)",
        "k = spectrum(h)",
        "rr = arithmetic[op=mul](x.re,k.re)",
        "ii = arithmetic[op=mul](x.im,k.im)",
        "ri = arithmetic[op=mul](x.re,k.im)",
        "ir = arithmetic[op=mul](x.im,k.re)",
        "r = arithmetic[op=sub](rr,ii)",
        "i = arithmetic[op=add](ri,ir)",
        "n = size(image)",
        "rn = arithmetic[op=mul](r,n.w)",
        "inorm = arithmetic[op=mul](i,n.w)",
        "v = synthesise(rn,inorm)",
        "s = spatialProcessor[form=dense,outside=wrap](image,kernel)",
        "e = difference(s,v)",
        "spatial <- s",
        "frequency <- v",
        "error <- e"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "h = spatialProcessor[form=dense,outside=wrap](impulse,kernel)",
        "x = spectrum(image)",
        "k = spectrum(h)",
        "rr = arithmetic[op=mul](x.re,k.re)",
        "ii = arithmetic[op=mul](x.im,k.im)",
        "ri = arithmetic[op=mul](x.re,k.im)",
        "ir = arithmetic[op=mul](x.im,k.re)",
        "r = arithmetic[op=sub](rr,ii)",
        "i = arithmetic[op=add](ri,ir)",
        "n = size(image)",
        "rn = arithmetic[op=mul](r,n.w)",
        "inorm = arithmetic[op=mul](i,n.w)",
        "v = synthesise(rn,inorm)",
        "s = spatialProcessor[form=dense,outside=zero](image,kernel)",
        "e = difference(s,v)",
        "spatial <- s",
        "frequency <- v",
        "error <- e"
      ],
      "views": { "grid": ["plot", "numbers", "pixels"] },
      "naiveWhy": {
        "zh": "周期频域计算不能直接声称等于零补边空间卷积。必须统一边界、核原点和归一化。",
        "en": "Periodic frequency processing is not directly equivalent to zero-padded spatial convolution. Match boundaries, kernel origin and normalisation."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "脉冲先经过自己的周期卷积器，自动建立核在周期数组中的原点。复数乘积的四项算术已放入起始板。",
          "en": "Sending an impulse through your periodic convolver establishes the kernel origin. Four complex-product arithmetic terms are already placed in the starter."
        }
      ],
      "starter": [
        "h = spatialProcessor[form=dense,outside=wrap](impulse,kernel)",
        "x = spectrum(image)",
        "k = spectrum(h)",
        "rr = arithmetic[op=mul](x.re,k.re)",
        "ii = arithmetic[op=mul](x.im,k.im)",
        "ri = arithmetic[op=mul](x.re,k.im)",
        "ir = arithmetic[op=mul](x.im,k.re)",
        "r = arithmetic[op=sub](rr,ii)"
      ],
